{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50162","headline":"秋夜讌徐四山亭（伯三七七一） · 杨齐悊","name":"秋夜讌徐四山亭（伯三七七一）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卷言北山岑，（「卷言」，项云当作「眷言」。\n）非谓靡远寻。\n庭际有幽石，自然保遐心。\n月下池凉（凉池）[一]彩，（「下池」，蒋项皆云二字当互乙。\n蒋云「月池」与「风竹」相对，项云「凉彩」犹冷光也。\n）风竹来清音。\n樽酒古籍人意，苍苍寒露深。\n（[一]池凉二字当互倒，深是动词。\n刘云：「『池』管作『迟』，待也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨齐悊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}